ad/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">13. KiCad basics</a> <em>(🔴)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://docs.kicad.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">14. KiCad docs</a> <em>(🔴)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://www.alternatezone.com/electronics/files/PCBDesignTutorialRevA.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">15. PCB design rules</a> <em>(🔴)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@PhilsLab\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">16. Phil's Lab PCB series</a> <em>(🔴)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://jlcpcb.com/help\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">17. Order from a fab</a> <em>(🔴)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://learn.adafruit.com/adafruit-guide-excellent-soldering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">18. Assemble &amp; test</a> <em>(🔴)</em></li></ol><p><em>Mirror of the interactive docs learning path · sektor9.dev</em></p>"
