    "html": "<h2>Path: ESP32 / IoT Mastery</h2><p>ESP32 to production IoT.</p><p>Follow the steps in order — each builds on the last.</p><ol><li><a href=\"https://elecdocs.sektor9.dev/paths/esp32/beginner/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">1. ESP32 beginner</a> <em>(🟢)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://docs.espressif.com/projects/esp-idf/en/latest/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">2. ESP-IDF docs</a> <em>(🟢)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://www.espressif.com/sites/default/files/documentation/esp32_technical_reference_manual_en.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">3. ESP32 technical reference</a> <em>(🟠)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@AndreasSpiess\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">4. The ESP32 ecosystem</a> <em>(🟠)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://docs.wokwi.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">5. Simulate before you build</a> <em>(🟢)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://elecdocs.sektor9.dev/synthesized/esp32-advanced/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">6. Wi-Fi on ESP32</a> <em>(🟠)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://elecdocs.sektor9.dev/synthesized/esp32-advanced/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">7. BLE basics</a> <em>(🟠)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://else.fcim.utm.md/pluginfile.php/90372/mod_resource/content/1/esp32%20programming.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">8. Internet of Things Projects with ESP32</a> <em>(🟠)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://elecdocs.sektor9.dev/synthesized/esp32-advanced/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">9. Interfacing sensors</a> <em>(🟠)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://www.hivemq.com/blog/mqtt-essentials-part-1-introducing-publish-subscribe/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">10. MQTT</a> <em>(🔴)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://elecdocs.sektor9.dev/synthesized/rtos-on-mcu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">11. FreeRTOS on ESP32</a> <em>(🔴)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://elecdocs.sektor9.dev/synthesized/esp32-advanced/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">12. Deep sleep &amp; power</a> <em>(🔴)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://docs.espressif.com/projects/esp-idf/en/latest/esp32/api-reference/network/esp_now.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">13. ESP-NOW</a> <em>(🔴)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://docs.espressif.com/projects/esp-idf/en/latest/esp32/security/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">14. Security &amp; provisioning</a> <em>(🔴)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://docs.espressif.com/projects/esp-idf/en/latest/esp32/api-reference/system/ota.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">15. Over-the-air updates</a> <em>(⚫)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://www.tensorflow.org/lite/microcontrollers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">16. TinyML on ESP32</a> <em>(⚫)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://platformio.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">17. PlatformIO</a> <em>(🟠)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://docs.espressif.com/projects/esp-idf/en/latest/esp32/api-reference/system/log.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">18. Deploy &amp; monitor</a> <em>(⚫)</em></li></ol><p><em>Mirror of the interactive docs learning path · sektor9.dev</em></p>"
