   {
    "name": "Path steps",
    "html": "<h2>Path: RTOS Engineer</h2><p>FreeRTOS to production real-time.</p><p>Follow the steps in order — each builds on the last.</p><ol><li><a href=\"https://elecdocs.sektor9.dev/synthesized/rtos-on-mcu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">1. RTOS on MCU (FreeRTOS)</a> <em>(🟠)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://www.freertos.org/Documentation/RTOS_book.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">2. Mastering the FreeRTOS Kernel</a> <em>(🟠)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://www.freertos.org/Documentation/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">3. FreeRTOS official docs</a> <em>(🟠)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://www.freertos.org/Documentation/02-Kernel/04-API-references/01-Task-creation/00-Task-creation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">4. Tasks &amp; scheduling</a> <em>(🔴)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://www.freertos.org/Documentation/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">5. Queues &amp; mutexes</a> <em>(🔴)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://www.freertos.org/Documentation/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">6. Semaphores &amp; event groups</a> <em>(🔴)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://www.santos.eng.br/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">7. Real-Time Systems theory</a> <em>(⚫)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@digikey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">8. Watch the RTOS scheduler in action</a> <em>(🔴)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Priority_inversion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">9. Priority inversion &amp; the priority ceiling</a> <em>(⚫)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://docs.zephyrproject.org/latest/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">10. Zephyr RTOS</a> <em>(⚫)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/wolfgang-zhang/rtos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">11. Build your own tiny RTOS</a> <em>(⚫)</em></li><li><a href=\"https://www.saleae.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">12. Measuring real-time behavior</a> <em>(⚫)</em></li></ol><p><em>Mirror of the interactive docs learning path · sektor9.dev</em></p>"
